\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.3}{\ignorespaces TSRV uses two scales on the same price path. \textbf  {Red:} fast scale (every tick), picks up both signal and noise. \textbf  {Blue:} slow scale (every 6 ticks), picks up signal with less noise but fewer observations. TSRV subtracts a noise correction derived from the fast scale to debias the slow-scale estimate.}}{41}{figure.3.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:tsrv-scales}{{3.3}{41}{TSRV uses two scales on the same price path. \textbf {Red:} fast scale (every tick), picks up both signal and noise. \textbf {Blue:} slow scale (every 6 ticks), picks up signal with less noise but fewer observations. TSRV subtracts a noise correction derived from the fast scale to debias the slow-scale estimate}{figure.3.3}{}}
